caption: Programmprüfung
tags: 
title: $:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/pages/printCheck
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

\import [[$:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/macros/runChecks]]

<!--
  printCheck — the "is the programme complete?" gate page (opened by the print button /
  the final "Weiter" step). It evaluates every cypro-check LIVE: if all pass it shows a
  success message with a "Programm drucken" button that opens the print document
  (print/shell) in a new window; otherwise it lists each unmet check (grouped by
  section) with a link to the page where it can be fixed.
-->
{{||$:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/viewtemplates/components/captionFix}}

<$set name="cypro-pass" filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[cypro-check]] :filter[all[tiddlers]subfilter{!!filter}]">

<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[cypro-check]] -[enlist<cypro-pass>]" variable="null"
       emptyMessage="""<div class="cypro-check-ok">

✅ ''Alle Angaben vollständig.''

Das Cybersicherheitsprogramm kann gedruckt werden.

<$button class="cypro-btn cypro-btn-primary" message="tm-open-window" param="$:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/print/shell" windowTitle="Druckansicht" template="$:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/print/shell"><span class="cypro-btn-label">Programm drucken</span></$button>

</div>""">
</$list>

<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[cypro-check]] -[enlist<cypro-pass>] +[limit[1]]" variable="null">

⚠️ ''Folgende Angaben sind noch unvollständig:''

<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[cypro-check]] -[enlist<cypro-pass>] +[nsort[section]]" variable="checkTiddler">
<div class="cypro-check-item">
<span class="cypro-check-section">''<$transclude tiddler=<<checkTiddler>> field="section"/>''</span>
<$link to={{{ [<checkTiddler>get[page]] }}}><$transclude tiddler=<<checkTiddler>> field="caption"/></$link>
<$transclude tiddler=<<checkTiddler>> mode="block"/>
</div>
</$list>

</$list>

</$set>

<div class="cypro-check-adminlink">
<$link to="$:/plugins/aeckert/cypro/pages/checksOverview">Prüf-Logik anzeigen →</$link>
</div>
